> > > > >
> > > > > Why not just use - as usual - the bootstrap and the typical CI (perc, bc)? Example:
> > > > >
> > > > > get.rsq <- function(x) lavInspect(x, "rsquare")
> > > > > boot <- bootstrapLavaan(fit, R = 1000, FUN = get.rsq, verbose = TRUE)
> > > > > alpha <- c(0.025, 0.975)
