Mal5 (which generates) the error is not even a correlation matrix; it is
a data.frame with 1 variable

Replace

fit.Mod <- sem(Mod, sample.cov =Mal5,sample.nobs=1193)

by

fit.Mod <- sem(Mod, sample.cov =d,sample.nobs=1193)

